  },
  data: {
    LLM: '1. Deal layout: 8 tableau depots (1 card each), 6 reserve piles (4 cards each), stock = remainder. 2. Play phase: Move exposed top cards from reserve or tableau to foundations (4 A-up, 4 K-down in suit) or build on tableau in ascending/descending suit (wrap King-Ace). Vacant depots accept any exposed card. Reserve piles cannot be built on. 3. Redeal: When no moves, deal 2 more cards to each reserve; repeat until 8 cards left, then 1 per depot. 4. Win when all 104 cards are on foundations.',
    Player: '1. Deal layout: 8 tableau depots (1 card each), 6 reserve piles (4 cards each), stock = remainder. 2. Play phase: Move exposed top cards from reserve or tableau to foundations (4 A-up, 4 K-down in suit) or build on tableau in ascending/descending suit (wrap King-Ace). Vacant depots accept any exposed card. Reserve piles cannot be built on. 3. Redeal: When no moves, deal 2 more cards to each reserve; repeat until 8 cards left, then 1 per depot. 4. Win when all 104 cards are on foundations.',
    objective: 'Consolidate all 104 cards into the 8 foundation piles (A-K and K-A).',
    gameplay: '1. Deal layout: 8 tableau depots (1 card each), 6 reserve piles (4 cards each), stock = remainder. 2. Play phase: Move exposed top cards from reserve or tableau to foundations (4 A-up, 4 K-down in suit) or build on tableau in ascending/descending suit (wrap King-Ace). Vacant depots accept any exposed card. Reserve piles cannot be built on. 3. Redeal: When no moves, deal 2 more cards to each reserve; repeat until 8 cards left, then 1 per depot. 4. Win when all 104 cards are on foundations.',
    keyRules: [
      'The reserve piles cannot be built upon; they only serve as sources of cards.',
      'Empty tableau depots can be filled by ANY available card.',
      'The game is won only when ALL cards are on foundations.',
    ],
